manufacturing guide ship as
.Pa LANGEXTENSION.md ,
.Pa TOPOLOGICAL.md ,
and
.Pa MANUFACTURING.md
under the documentation directory
.Pq Pa share/doc/coscad with Homebrew .
The exported
.Pa .scad
files open in OpenSCAD with the BOSL2 library:
.Lk https://openscad.org
and
.Lk https://github.com/BelfrySCAD/BOSL2 .
